<a name="details" id="details"></a><h2 id="header-details" class="groupheader">Detailed Description</h2>
<div class="textblock"><p>Connection state corresponding to a server starting up. Starts the server when entering the state. If successful, transitions to the ServerListening state, if not, transitions back to the Offline state. </p>
